      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Asha Moreno:</b> The feed pushes repackaged builds past you mixed in with records that are perfectly legitimate. Tear down a clean one and you have told staff their working app is poison, which costs us the trust we need for the next warning. Precision here is the entire job.",
      "taskInstructions": "Click each <b>MALICIOUS BUILD</b> before its ring closes and leave <b>VERIFIED PACKAGE</b> targets alone. Four builds slipping past ends the run.",
      "taskQuestion": "Triage the LanternPass packages.",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Asha Moreno:</b> You removed the malicious builds without treating every package as guilty. Verification kept the response precise."
